config BR2_PACKAGE_UBOOT_T618
	bool "uboot for Unisoc UMS512 / T618"
	help
	  Vendor U-Boot for the Unisoc UMS512 (T618), built from source and
	  packed into a stock DHTB image wrapper.

	  Produces images/u-boot.img, which genimage writes to the raw partition
	  GPT-named "uboot" -- where the SPL looks for it.

	  https://github.com/beebono/u-boot-ums512
